{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>郭柏妍（Rosita）早前在劇集《夫妻的博奕》中飾演「綠茶小三」雪文一角，演技獲不少觀眾力讚。近日 Rosita 飛到泰國旅行，更入鄉隨俗體驗當地大熱的傳統泰服打卡。當地的攝影師率先分享一連串「唯美福利圖」，其仙氣大爆發的模樣瞬間秒殺全網。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_0dabbfa3180fffa7-1183\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中可見，她穿上淺藍色傳統泰服，單肩的設計完美展現了她白滑的香肩，配搭華麗的銀色腰帶、復古頸鏈及頭飾，高貴之餘又不失少女感。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_0dabbfa3180fffa7-1183\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"704fc076-2446-48f3-9b96-ded9925a5650.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026yfY4rSw05C1789634498.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"704fc076-2446-48f3-9b96-ded9925a5650.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"87c29cc9-ff41-4436-afef-088bc2ce7c00.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YRM9OXxZKV1789634497.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"87c29cc9-ff41-4436-afef-088bc2ce7c00.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_0dabbfa3180fffa7-1184\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Rosita 在極具特色的鄭王廟擺出多個甫士，單手托腮展現招牌甜美笑容，又手執傳統紙傘回眸一笑，電暈一眾粉絲，難怪令網民睇到心心眼狂畀 Like！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.682489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}